# editors.list — the editors, and what their configs assume is installed
# (install/45-editors.sh clones the configs and adds the npm servers).
emacs-x11       # Emacs with its own window; SLIME reaches StumpWM on port 4004
neovim
# pdf-tools (Emacs) builds its epdfinfo helper the first time:
pkg-config
autoconf
automake
poppler-glib-devel
libpng-devel
zlib-devel
# language servers that Void packages; the npm ones come from 45-editors
ccls                    # C and C++
lua-language-server
gopls                   # Go
efm-langserver          # linters and formatters (Neovim)
tree-sitter-cli         # `tree-sitter`: nvim-treesitter builds its parsers with it.
                        # (Void's plain tree-sitter package is only the library.)
nodejs                  # npm, for typescript-language-server, pyright, bash-language-server
